				"The &eDrygmy&r is a small gnome-like creature with antlers, and can be found in the wild. In exchange for a &bWilden Horn&r dropped at its feet, it will give you a &bDrygmy Shard&r, which can be used to create its &bCharm&r. &6Right click the Charm on &bMossy Cobblestone&r."
				"当它跟随你时，会提高你的土系法术伤害，并提升&a战利品&r。"
				"多个&eDrygmy&r可以被指派给单个&bHenge&r，这些生物会&a收集掉落物和经验宝石&r，并且不会对半径10格内的&eLivestock&r造成伤害！收集完毕后，它们会将物品放置到附近的物品栏中，并且必须用&aSource&r来为其能力充能。"
			]
